@baseUrl=http://localhost:3000/api

### Rota Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### Listar Todos os Usuários
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

### Criar um novo Usuário
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Usuario Teste 3",
    "email":"teste3@email.com",
    "phone":"99999999997",
    "message":"Teste de mensagem"
}

### Buscar Usuario por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Atualizar um Usuario existente
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name":"Usuario Alterado",
    "email":"teste_alterado@email.com",
    "phone":"99999999998",
    "message":"Teste de Menasgem de Atualizacao"
}

### Deletar Usuário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/2
Content-Type: application/json